43
00:06:27,375 --> 00:06:31,408
[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

44
00:06:32,007 --> 00:06:40,935
[Slow] 九州新幹線は、何日ぶりに全線で運行を再開しましたか。

45
00:06:41,735 --> 00:06:45,911
[Host] Fifty-two days. It resumed yesterday morning at six.

46
00:06:46,512 --> 00:06:52,223
[Slow] 電車が走れなくなったのは、どうしてですか。

47
00:06:53,024 --> 00:07:00,560
[Host] Because the Kumamoto earthquake in July damaged the section between Kumamoto Station and Shin-Minamata Station.

48
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:07,232
[Slow] 国は10月から、何を始める予定ですか。

49
00:07:08,031 --> 00:07:13,144
[Host] A recovery support program that makes travel and hotels in Kyushu cheaper.

50
00:07:13,744 --> 00:07:24,351
[Host] That's all for today. If you are traveling in Kyushu during the holidays, the bullet train is back on its full route — good news for the whole region. See you tomorrow!

51
00:07:24,951 --> 00:07:27,351
[News] また明日。
